# Ignore file for aics-witness/Dockerfile (BuildKit picks up
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile; it replaces any
# .dockerignore at the root of the build context).
# The build context is packages/; the image needs aics-tlog/ and aics-witness/
# sources only. Never send keys, databases, configs or local tool state.
*
!aics-tlog
!aics-witness
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/tests
**/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.seed
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/witness.json
**/.DS_Store
